{"t":"Blood Herb Quest/Spoiler","s":"blood-herb-quest-spoiler-325f6","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Venore_Rotworm_Cave_Entrance_73f2d4.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Blood Herb Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Witchesbroom Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(20+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 2000<br/>Christmas Update 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a> the witch talks about the usefulness of this herb. It grows near dead trees, perhaps you should try the dead tree not far from her house?\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Greenclaw Swamp</a>, Near <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>, weaker <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">poisonous creatures</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herb</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Witchesbroom\">Witchesbroom</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a>, or equivalent</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a>, or equivalent</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a>, or equivalent</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison%20Rune\">Antidote Runes</a> or the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Spell</a> (recommended only).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, leave via the south-west exit, following the road north-west. About 3/4th of the way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Bridge\">Dwarf Bridge</a>, branch off north and find the hole to <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Venore Rotworm Cave</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32699,32018,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32699, 32018, 7)</a>). Open the <a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">Loose Stone Pile</a> with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a> and go in.\n</p><p>Go down another floor and head north. Rope up when you find the next rope hole and follow the path to the north-east end of the cave. At the end of the cave there are 3 branches: the northern set of ramps leads to the <a href=\"#/quest/bewitched\">Bewitched</a> cauldron, the eastern hole leads to the <a href=\"#/quest/silver-brooch-quest\">Silver Brooch Quest</a>. The blood herb quest is up the ladder.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"89c6fb4c1535d23d4af088baaddc5b17\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Venore_Rotworm_Cave_Entrance-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:152px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Rotworm_Cave_Entrance_73f2d4.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Venore Rotworm Cave Entrance.png (215 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Venore_Rotworm_Cave_Map_to_Wyda_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:148px; width:183px; top:2px;\"><img alt=\"Start Rope spot\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption='&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Start&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Rope spot' height=\"149\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Rotworm_Cave_Map_to_Wyda_1_13ba4b.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Venore Rotworm Cave Map to Wyda 1.png (2 KB)\" width=\"183\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Start<br/><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Rope spot</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Venore_Rotworm_Cave_Map_to_Wyda_2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:152px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Start Ladder up\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption='&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Start&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Ladder up' height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Rotworm_Cave_Map_to_Wyda_2_48fbb0.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Venore Rotworm Cave Map to Wyda 2.png (4 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Start<br/><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00ff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Ladder up</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:154px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Venore_Rotworm_Cave_to_Wyda-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px; top:0.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Venore_Rotworm_Cave_to_Wyda_06d782.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Venore Rotworm Cave to Wyda.png (172 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<p>Go up the ladder and you'll be on the surface with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wasp\">Wasp</a> and a coffin. In the coffin is <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%205000\">Key 5000</a> which opens <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a>'s home, but you don't need it.\n</p><p>Go up another ladder to reach <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a>'s home. Now walk along the boards bordering the house until the end. Be careful because 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witches</a> spawn on a hill to the east and can shoot you as you walk. Go down the ladder and cut the <a href=\"#/wiki/Jungle%20Grass\">Jungle Grass</a> to the south. Go south under the witch hill and then east to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Loose%20Stone%20Pile\">Loose Stone Pile</a>. Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a> and go in. Follow the passage to the east. The path will now branch in 2. The eastern ramp down leads you to a part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a>, where <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Count\">The Count</a> is spawned. The blood herb quest is up the western ramp. Prepare yourself and go up to fight a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>. Kill the giant spider and open the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dead%20Tree\">Dead Tree</a> on the north side of the small piece of land to receive the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herb</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"tw-item-obtained\"><div class=\"tw-bp-head\">Obtained</div><div class=\"tw-bp-slot\"><div class=\"tw-bp-slot-link\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\"> </a></div><div class=\"tw-bp-slot-img\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_87bf9c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"1\" hash=\"ae11250c987ca3d15fe32b0b6933dd92\" id=\"w-gallery-1\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Blood_Herb_Quest_Witches-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_Quest_Witches_7644c5.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Blood Herb Quest Witches.png (205 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Blood_Herb_Quest_Witch_Map-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:134px; width:165px; top:8.5px;\"><img alt=\"Witch hill Ladder down\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption='&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff0000; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;  hill&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Ladder down' height=\"135\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_Quest_Witch_Map_8d7d37.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Blood Herb Quest Witch Map.png (2 KB)\" width=\"165\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff0000; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witch</a> hill<br/><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> Ladder down</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Blood_Herb_Quest_Hole-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_Quest_Hole_263c08.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Blood Herb Quest Hole.png (237 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Blood_Herb_Quest_Ramp-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_Quest_Ramp_83f6a2.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Blood Herb Quest Ramp.png (108 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Blood_Herb_Quest_Tree-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Herb_Quest_Tree_600a32.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Blood Herb Quest Tree.png (225 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<p>Now backtrack to <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyda\">Wyda</a> and decide if you want to trade the <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herb</a> you found for her <a href=\"#/wiki/Witchesbroom\">Witchesbroom</a>. Lots of players think this is not worth it because <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Herb\">Blood Herb</a> is very valuable decoration. The choice is yours. \n</p>\n<div class=\"tw-item-obtained\"><div class=\"tw-bp-head\">Obtained</div><div class=\"tw-bp-slot\"><div class=\"tw-bp-slot-link\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Witchesbroom\"> </a></div><div class=\"tw-bp-slot-img\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Witchesbroom_d05680.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></div>\n<p>You can also save your Blood Herb for <a href=\"#/quest/bored-mini-world-change\">when Wyda is bored</a> for a chance to obtain a <a href=\"#/wiki/Torn%20Teddy\">Torn Teddy</a>.\n</p></div>","quests":[]}